# .dockerignore — exclude non-production files from Docker image
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/tests/
**/test_*.py
**/*_test.py
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/node_modules
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/target/          # Rust build artifacts (copied separately)
**/qsec-doc/
**/qsec-enterprise/docker/  # avoid self-inclusion
**/*.md             # README files not needed in image
